        "summary": "`endsWith('at')` matches `format`/`heat`/`flat`; `endsWith('id')` matches `grid`/`paid`/`android`. Confirmed: decideRewrite('format', 1700000001, ...) \u2192 {token:'{{now.unix}}'}. Silently corrupts user fixtures.",
