        "task_id": 15,
        "status": "resolved",
        "resolution": "Added manifest-drift detection: walkAndRewrite now accepts a skip predicate; enhanceFile compares current value with the stored generated token per manifest entry and skips re-enhance when the user has edited the token. Test: 'preserves user edits to generated tokens and emits a drift warning (REV-2)'."
